id=perfspoof-romguard
name=Performance Spoof (ROM watchdog)
version=1.1
versionCode=2
author=JoyBoy / multi-ROM port
description=Keeps com.antutu.ABenchMark alive on HyperOS, ColorOS, OxygenOS and realme UI. Re-applies the AppOps, doze whitelist, standby bucket and freezer exemptions, and restarts the performance service when the ROM stops it. The app itself is installed separately.
